xt","ej_btn1","ej_btn2"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/am-home-eindejaar-kaarsen.jpg","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/am-home-eindejaar-kaarsen.jpg","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"image_link":"","full_width":true,"text_alignment":"center left","mobile_overlay_under":true,"overlay_style":"box"}},"geschenken":{"type":"product-list","settings":{"title":"Klaar om te geven","product_list":["el-fassia","sahara-pot","leopard","zebra","sahara-beehive","berberia","nazar","geo"],"show_vendor":false,"enable_carousel":true,"grid":4,"color_scheme":"default","full_width":false}},"professionals":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"pro_sub":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"Voor professionals"}},"pro_head":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Architecten, winkels en tegelhandels.","use_h1":false}},"pro_text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>In de pro-webshop bestel je met je eigen voorwaarden: nettoprijzen excl. btw en het volledige gamma, ook de grote potten.<\/p><p>Zelliges bestel je als stalen, los of gekleefd op een staalbord. Voor een project of een maatkleur maak ik een offerte op maat.<\/p><p>Atelier Marhaban verzorgt import, transport en douane. De stock ligt in Lievegem.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"pro_btn1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Pro-account aanvragen","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/professionals","button_style":"primary"}},"pro_btn2":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Inloggen","button_link":"https:\/\/pro.atelier-marhaban.com\/web\/login","button_style":"secondary"}}},"block_order":["pro_sub","pro_head","pro_text","pro_btn1","pro_btn2"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/am-home-atelier-lievegem.jpg","image_width":600,"image_link":"","image_position":"left","text_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"2"}},"zelliges_buiten":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"zb_sub":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"Zelliges van Mohcin"}},"zb_head":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Gemaakt voor buiten.","use_h1":false}},"zb_text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Gewone zelliges bevatten kleine stukjes kalk in de klei. Die houden vocht vast, en bij vorst springt het glazuur. Mohcin werkt met klei uit Fez en een proces zonder dat probleem.<\/p><p>TCKI testte de tegels: geen vorstschade, bestand tegen thermoshock en tegen zwembadchloor (klasse A). Ze nemen wel vocht op. Achter de tegels hoort dus een waterdichte laag.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"zb_btn":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Bekijk de zelliges","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/zelliges","button_style":"secondary"}}},"block_order":["zb_sub","zb_head","zb_text","zb_btn"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/am-home-zelliges-zwembad.jpg","image_width":600,"image_link":"","image_position":"right","text_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"default"}},"over_thomas":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"ot_sub":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"Over Atelier Marhaban"}},"ot_head":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Ik ben Thomas.","use_h1":false}},"ot_text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Ik zocht zelliges voor een buitenzwembad in Gent en vond er geen die ons klimaat aankon. Zo kwam ik bij Mohcin in Marrakech terecht.<\/p><p>Vandaag ga ik zelf naar de ateliers, bekijk ik het werk en zeg ik nee als het niet goed genoeg is. Wat binnenkomt, ligt in Lievegem. Je kan het er komen bekijken, op afspraak.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"ot_btn1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Afspraak in de showroom","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/contact","button_style":"primary"}},"ot_btn2":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Lees meer over Atelier Marhaban","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/over-ons","button_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["ot_sub","ot_head","ot_text","ot_btn1","ot_btn2"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/am-home-thomas-atelier-marrakech.jpg","image_width":500,"image_link":"","image_position":"left","text_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"default"}},"nieuwsbrief":{"type":"newsletter","settings":{"title":"Nieuw in het atelier","subheading":"<p>Nieuwe kleuren en potten, en wat er in Marrakech gemaakt wordt.<\/p>","color_scheme":"1"}}},"order":["hero","shop_tegels","eindejaar","geschenken","professionals","zelliges_buiten","over_thomas","nieuwsbrief"]}